    <string name="ui_hearing_heading">Personalize for my hearing</string>
    <string name="ui_hearing_hint">Plays quiet tones that get gradually louder at 6 frequencies. Tap the button as soon as you hear one. Use headphones in a quiet room and set the volume low first. This is a rough self-check, not a medical test; results depend on your headphones and volume. It only raises the bands you hear less well, by at most 12 dB.</string>
